Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.49,0:01:40.78,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Yes！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.18,0:01:43.52,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Yes！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.16,0:01:40.45,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Pretty cu·cu·cu·cure
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.62,0:01:43.33,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Everybody Yes, fight！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.50,0:01:45.96,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,心跳不已  开怀欢笑
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.21,0:01:48.58,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Smile go go！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.75,0:01:49.53,OP＆ED,,0,0,35,,Precure~！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.43,0:01:53.34,OP＆ED,,0,0,35,,Yes！P·re·cu·re·5！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.47,0:01:57.80,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,长大后想做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.41,0:02:00.09,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,想·做·想做·什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.10,0:02:02.85,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,想亲手尝试的事有很多！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.95,0:02:05.12,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,很・多・都・想・做！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.31,0:02:10.02,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,哭鼻子是不能解决问题的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.23,0:02:14.22,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,用心中的橡皮拭去眼泪吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.08,0:02:19.45,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Go！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.78,0:02:19.00,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Metamorphose！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.00,0:02:23.62,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,为梦想而生
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.54,0:02:22.91,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,One！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.17,0:02:23.57,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Two！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.94,0:02:24.74,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Three！Four！Five！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.87,0:02:29.00,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,飞翔吧 努力的女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.08,0:02:28.40,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Five！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.65,0:02:29.05,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Four！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.45,0:02:30.23,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Three！Two！One！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.25,0:02:34.74,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,未来不是只论成败
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.05,0:02:38.13,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,描绘自己的明天吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.71,0:02:40.11,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Go！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.02,0:02:41.48,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,GoGo！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.08,0:02:43.93,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Go Go Go Go！Yes！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.38,0:02:42.93,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,转危为机 坚强地变身！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.62,0:02:47.00,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Yes！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.97,0:02:46.73,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Pretty cu·cu·cu·cure
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.34,0:02:49.68,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Yes！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.73,0:02:49.23,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Everybody Yes, Huslte！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.35,0:02:51.94,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,心跳不已  喜笑颜开
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.03,0:02:54.53,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Smile go go！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.77,0:02:55.14,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Go！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.97,0:02:56.48,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Yes！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.57,0:02:59.95,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,1. 2. 3. 4 Precure（5!）
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default CN,,0,0,0,,ED
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.85,0:22:16.85,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,想要做梦 想要恋爱
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.85,0:22:19.57,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,想做很多事情
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.86,0:22:22.40,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,微笑就是咒語
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.40,0:22:26.16,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Pre pre precure·Five☆
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.78,0:22:28.62,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Yeah~！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.21,0:22:39.09,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,像椰子和果仁那般
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.09,0:22:41.04,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,柔軟甜美的吻
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.26,0:22:45.05,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,沉醉其中时
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.05,0:22:47.30,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,闹钟响了起来
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.38,0:22:50.39,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,得把窗帘打开
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.89,0:22:53.39,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,去寻找梦的续集
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.93,0:22:57.02,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,希望那灿烂的阳光
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.02,0:22:59.27,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,不要把我的心溶化
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.90,0:23:00.60,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Oh～！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.60,0:23:06.36,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,太阳公公的表情多么开朗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.61,0:23:12.37,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,为何可以笑得这么开怀!?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.58,0:23:18.16,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,其实我的心情也是同样明亮的 color
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.16,0:23:23.21,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,闪闪发亮吧 My True Love！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.26,0:23:28.26,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,想要做梦 想要恋爱
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.26,0:23:31.05,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,想做很多事情
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.14,0:23:33.43,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,微笑就是咒语
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.68,0:23:35.14,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,可爱！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.14,0:23:36.68,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,最棒！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.68,0:23:40.02,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Pre pre precure·Five☆
